/a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all\" href=\"/salary\"><svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6\"></path></svg>Salary After Tax</a></div></section><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link2 lucide-link-2 h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2\"></path><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Link to This Calculator</h3></div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Help others find this free tool — add a link to your website or blog.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground\">HTML Link Code</label><div class=\"relative\"><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-muted/30 border border-border/20 p-3 text-xs text-foreground/80 font-mono\">&lt;a href=&quot;https://thetaxcalc.com/overtime-tax-calculator&quot; title=&quot;Free Overtime Tax Calculator 2026 — After-Tax OT Pay&quot;&gt;Free Overtime Tax Calculator 2026 — After-Tax OT Pay&lt;/a&gt;</pre><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outl